   213	# functions BY NAME, so an upstream rename fails HERE, loudly, instead of
   214	# silently taking the identity path at the first repair. _wbm_route_row_ok is
   215	# asserted even though doctor never calls it directly: it is what makes
   216	# _wbm_route_src fail-closed, and a reader missing it would answer rc=2 to
