   218	# oracle's own fragment harness.)
   219	# rail round-6 F2 added _wbm_route_table_gate to that set: the three readers
   220	# call it, so a library missing it would answer rc=2 to every lookup — the
   221	# right posture, reached the wrong way and with no name attached to it.
   222	# rail round-7 F2 added _wbm_source_confined for the same reason: _restore_file
