templates/settings/settings.user.json:389:        "_comment": "PLAN-058 Phase A (ADR-077): PostToolUse scanner for WebFetch + WebSearch tool responses. Scans for prompt-injection (6 families) + harness-mimicry (4 families). Advisory only; never blocks. Kill-switch CEO_WEBFETCH_INJECTION_SCAN=0. Incident 2026-04-24 remediation. Audit-v2 C4-P0-04 mirror from dogfood settings.json.",
templates/settings/settings.user.json:401:        "_comment": "PLAN-052 / ADR-083: PostToolUse scanner for MCP tool responses. Scans for harness-mimicry + directive-prose patterns. ADVISORY only — never blocks. Emits mcp_injection_finding audit event when match fires. Kill-switch CEO_MCP_SCANNER_DISABLE=1. Audit-v2 C4-P0-04 mirror from dogfood settings.json.",
templates/settings/settings.user.json:519:        "_comment": "PLAN-028 / ADR-056 lifecycle hook. Fires pre-model-inference on each user prompt — redact-hit breadcrumb + 5-family injection smell-test + advisory banner on hit. Observer-only at State 0 (never blocks). Also carries the PLAN-122 optimizer recommender (advisory additionalContext; never dispatches). Kill-switches: CEO_EXTENDED_LIFECYCLE=0 (disables hook), CEO_PROMPT_INJECTION_SCAN=0 (disables only the scan), CEO_OPTIMIZER=0 (disables only the recommender).",
templates/settings/settings.user.json:533:        "_comment": "PLAN-028 / ADR-056 lifecycle hook. Fires on SIGINT / SIGTERM / user_stop — emit session_stop event + filelock drain + stale-lock release. Graceful cleanup only; never blocks. Kill-switch: CEO_EXTENDED_LIFECYCLE=0.",
templates/settings/settings.user.json:571:        "_comment": "PLAN-135 W2 H2: ConfigChange guard — ADVISORY audit + advisory-block of out-of-band settings.json tamper (the S197 class). Resolves multi-layer settings via _lib/effective_config (shared FORBIDDEN-KEYS source) + classifies tamper on the settings-FILE surfaces; emits config_change_observed (benign) / config_change_forbidden_key (advisory-block, ONE per tamper class). Fail-OPEN, never blocks on infra. Honest coverage boundary: disarmed by disableAllHooks + blind to outside-harness edits; compensators = /ceo-boot tripwires (S3) + W5 O10 OTEL witness (ADR-153 §H2). Kill: CEO_CONFIG_CHANGE_GUARD=0.",
templates/settings/settings.user.json:585:        "_comment": "PLAN-135 W2 H3: SubagentStart lifecycle recorder — records the spawn instant + spawn context (agent_type, session binding) into a local sidecar keyed by sha256(agent_id)[:16] (raw agent_id NEVER persisted). The SubagentStop half (check_fluency_nudge.py) consumes it + agent_transcript_path to emit ONE closed-enum subagent_lifecycle_observed bracket (per-agent wall-time + token + claim; feeds persona-ledger). ADVISORY, fail-OPEN, never blocks, NO audit action from this hook. Kill: CEO_SUBAGENT_LIFECYCLE=0.",
templates/settings/settings.user.json:599:        "_comment": "PLAN-135 W2 H8: Setup-event post-install self-verification (init matcher) — validate-governance --fast + verify-counts + hook exec-bits (the S228 exec-bit class) + CLAUDE_ENV_FILE allowlist persistence (explicit CEO_* include-list; every override/escape-hatch/kill-switch EXCLUDED, S185/S197 stale-override class). ADVISORY + fail-open; NEVER blocks. Kill-switch: CEO_SETUP_VERIFICATION=0.",
templates/settings/settings.user.json:622:  "_model_comment": "PLAN-163 T1.1 / FXe (ADR-181 Contingency). Advisory session-default pin so a fresh `install --ceremony user` does NOT inherit the CC 2.1.220 sonnet-5 tier-default (the silent-flip that settings.base.json closes for the maintainer path). This is the MINIMUM pin for the advisory profile: it deliberately OMITS availableModels + enforceAvailableModels so the user path stays non-enforcing (advisory-only) by design. Do NOT add availableModels/enforceAvailableModels here — that would change the profile's advisory nature.",
